### Health Check


GET http://localhost:3000/health

### Logging Endpoint

POST http://localhost:3000/logging/ 
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "level": "info",
    "message": "This is a test log message"
}

### Filtering Endpoint

GET http://localhost:3000/filtering/2026-09-21T04:00:00.00Z/2026-09-21T04:30:00.00Z

### Paginated Endpoint

GET http://localhost:3000/filtering?page=1&limit=2